        "thought_text": "Strategy 2: Instead of greedily placing the minimum possible values, consider the maximum mex value that can be achieved by strategically placing values in the array. This involves ensuring that the mex value is present in at least one of the chosen subarrays and maximizing its occurrence across all subarrays.",
