        "node_id": "n_2_3df0bc",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of creating a frequency map of all mex values required by the subarrays and distributing them optimally is not sufficient. It fails to consider the overlap between subarrays and the optimal distribution of values to maximize the minimum mex. A more effective strategy would be to use a greedy approach that assigns values to the array based on the subarrays' requirements, ensuring that the mex of each subarray is maximized while minimizing the overall mex.",
